//
//  Secrets.xcconfig
//  diewithoutregrets
//
//  Created by Jason Mayo on 2025/04/17.
//
//  How the OpenAI key is provided to builds:
//
//  • Xcode Cloud: the workflow's "Environment Variables" pane defines
//    OPENAI_API_KEY. The first assignment below picks it up via
//    $(OPENAI_API_KEY), which falls through to the shell env when the
//    variable is undefined inside the xcconfig itself.
//
//  • Local archive / Run from Xcode: that env var doesn't exist on your
//    machine, so create a sibling file named "Secrets.local.xcconfig"
//    (gitignored) containing:
//
//        OPENAI_API_KEY = sk-your-real-key-here
//
//    The `#include?` directive below loads it if present and overrides
//    the env-var fallback. Missing-file is silent — perfect for CI.
//
//  Result: CI keeps working unchanged, and local Archive → Upload now
//  ships a working AI flashcard generator instead of an empty key.
//

OPENAI_API_KEY = $(OPENAI_API_KEY)
#include? "Secrets.local.xcconfig"
